## Custom Tags & Context

### Standard Tags

Always include these tags for better error grouping:

```typescript
Sentry.setTag('environment', process.env.NODE_ENV);
Sentry.setTag('service', 'pdflab-backend');
Sentry.setTag('version', '1.1.0');
```

### User Context

For authenticated requests:

```typescript
Sentry.setUser({
  id: user.id,
  email: user.email, // Only if sendDefaultPii is true
  plan: user.plan,
  ip_address: '{{auto}}', // Auto-detect IP
});
```

### Transaction Context

For conversion jobs:

```typescript
Sentry.setContext('conversion', {
  job_id: jobId,
  conversion_type: conversionType,
  file_size: fileSize,
  output_format: outputFormat,
  user_plan: user.plan,
});
```

### Batch Processing Context

```typescript
Sentry.setContext('batch', {
  batch_id: batchId,
  total_files: totalFiles,
  operation_type: operationType,
  batch_size_mb: totalSizeMB,
});
```

