## Error Handling Best Practices

### 1. Critical Path Monitoring

**CloudConvert Processing**:
```typescript
try {
  const result = await cloudConvertService.convertPDF(inputFile, outputFile, format);
} catch (error) {
  Sentry.captureException(error, {
    tags: {
      critical: true,
      service: 'cloudconvert',
      operation: 'convert',
    },
    contexts: {
      conversion: {
        job_id: job.id,
        format: format,
        file_size: job.file_size,
      },
    },
    level: 'error',
  });
  throw error; // Re-throw after logging
}
```

**Payment Processing**:
```typescript
try {
  await payfastService.activateSubscription(userId, planType);
} catch (error) {
  Sentry.captureException(error, {
    tags: {
      critical: true,
      service: 'payfast',
      operation: 'subscription_activation',
      revenue_impact: 'high',
    },
    user: { id: userId },
    level: 'fatal', // Highest severity
  });
  // Alert finance team
  throw error;
}
```

### 2. Performance Monitoring

**Track Long-Running Operations**:
```typescript
const transaction = Sentry.startTransaction({
  op: 'batch.processing',
  name: 'Process Batch Conversion',
  tags: {
    batch_id: batchId,
    file_count: files.length,
  },
});

try {
  for (const file of files) {
    const span = transaction.startChild({
      op: 'conversion',
      description: `Convert ${file.name}`,
    });

    await processFile(file);

    span.finish();
  }

  transaction.setStatus('ok');
} catch (error) {
  transaction.setStatus('internal_error');
  Sentry.captureException(error);
} finally {
  transaction.finish();
}
```

### 3. Breadcrumbs for Context

**Add breadcrumbs before critical operations**:
```typescript
Sentry.addBreadcrumb({
  category: 'conversion',
  message: 'Starting PDF compression',
  level: 'info',
  data: {
    compression_level: compressionLevel,
    file_size: fileSize,
    job_id: jobId,
  },
});

// ... perform compression

Sentry.addBreadcrumb({
  category: 'conversion',
  message: 'Compression completed successfully',
  level: 'info',
  data: {
    original_size: originalSize,
    compressed_size: compressedSize,
    ratio: compressionRatio,
  },
});
```

