## Notification Channels Setup

### Slack Integration

**1. Add Sentry Slack App**:
- Go to https://pdf-lab-pro.sentry.io/settings/integrations/slack/
- Click "Add to Slack"
- Authorize for your workspace

**2. Configure Channels**:
- `#alerts-critical` - Critical errors (P1)
- `#alerts-performance` - Performance issues (P2)
- `#alerts-payments` - Payment/revenue errors
- `#dev-errors` - Development/staging errors

**3. Alert Rules**:
```
Critical Errors → #alerts-critical (immediate)
Performance Degradation → #alerts-performance (5min delay)
Payment Failures → #alerts-payments (immediate)
New Errors (dev) → #dev-errors (batched hourly)
```

### Email Alerts

**Configure in**: Settings > Notifications

**Recipients**:
- Critical alerts → On-call engineer + team lead
- Performance alerts → Dev team
- Payment alerts → Finance + dev team
- Weekly digest → All team members

