## Quick Commands

```bash
# Check if Sentry is initialized in logs
docker logs pdflab-backend-prod | grep -i sentry

# Test Sentry connection
curl -X POST https://pdflab.pro/api/test/sentry-error

# View Sentry events in last hour
# (Requires Sentry CLI and auth)
sentry-cli events list --project pdflab-backend --last 1h

# Upload source maps for new release
npm run build
sentry-cli releases new 1.1.0
sentry-cli releases files 1.1.0 upload-sourcemaps ./dist
sentry-cli releases finalize 1.1.0

# Deploy new release
sentry-cli releases deploys 1.1.0 new -e production
```

